{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50722","headline":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其五（原注：偶作。） · 张祜","name":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其五（原注：偶作。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南穷海徼北天涯，惆怅亡羊是路歧。\n眼下已隳梁武佛，耳中犹听魏文诗。\n三茅道士朝携手，五柳先生夜对棊。\n自向庐山爲一社，百年生计任婴儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}